WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.130
The rumors say that the scarlet plum trees
that blossom deep in the valley...

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.520
are the manifestation of a divine energy
that emanates from the ground,

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.920
and because of this, these trees
are considered sacrosanct.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.030
For some reason, these trees bloom
even when they're out of season,

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.970
but the rumor goes that if you
take them out of this valley,

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.810
their link with the divine energy is
broken and they wither and die.

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:54.800
When the country was ravaged by conflict, around
the time of the Northern and Southern Dynasties...

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.540
a Buddhist wood-carver...

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:02.050
felled one of these holy trees to carve a statue of
an angel and enshrined it here to usher in peace.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.280
This is how the shrine
came to be.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:08.580
So, this is the Scarlet
Angel. I see.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:13.170
So, that means Ichiren Ozaki based
his script on this legend.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:16.110
A divine energy that emanates
from the ground?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.770
That's what the scarlet
plum tree is?

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:23.750
Episode 48 - A Night
of Dreams

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.220
Which means we're standing on the hallowed
ground of the Scarlet Angel.

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:31.250
I'd really like to see
your Scarlet Angel.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:39.340
I want you to like
my Scarlet Angel.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:51.180
I'm surprised you'd say
something like that.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:55.200
I thought you hated me.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:02.330
Up till now, I was under the impression
that you didn't like me at all either.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.090
Why ever did you think that?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.520
Well, because...

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.910
I suppose I'm exactly the kind
of man you'd take a dislike to.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.510
You don't have to answer.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.300
But I do feel a bit better now.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:26.400
For a very long time now, I've been a hundred
percent certain that you hated me.

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:35.600
I like watching you on stage, and not
once have I ever not liked you.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.560
Please, just tell me that you're
that man, Mr. Hayami!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:41.230
Tell me you're Mr.
Purple Roses!

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:44.970
If you only say that, I can
jump into your arms...

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:50.970
If only I could see your Scarlet
Angel, I'd be so...

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:03.160
Ms. Tsukikage is probably getting
very worried about you by now.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:06.980
Everyone's worried
about you too.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.730
It's getting cold.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.580
Do you want to
huddle closer?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.710
If it's okay for you, that is.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:20.420
If you come over here,

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.930
it'll be a little warmer than sitting
over there by yourself.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:30.170
But if you want to stay
cold, that's fine too.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:33.170
No, Mr. Hayami.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.660
Please warm me up.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:42.660
My hands and feet are frozen, and I can
feel a shiver running up my back.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:46.930
So, go ahead. Just like you did
when it was raining that time.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.840
I mean, I might be a golden
egg, right?

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:54.510
So, please do it for me, Mr. Hayami.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.010
Are you serious?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:03.000
Sleep, little one.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:06.130
Before I start getting
strange ideas.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.150
Something's got into
both of us tonight.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.430
When we wake up tomorrow,
all of this will be a dream.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.440
What a long and short night.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.850
There will be no good dreams tonight.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:34.280
They say the divine energy of the Scarlet
Angel causes the plum trees to blossom.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.250
These sacred flowers cannot bloom
anywhere else but in this valley.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:43.210
I bet if I leave this place, everything that
happened will be locked away again.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.170
Mr. Hayami!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:53.830
Um, I just wanted to apologize for causing
you all that trouble yesterday.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.750
This is a piece of my heart.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.620
I'm never going to
forget last night.

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:09.250
Thank you for everything you've
done for me. I mean it.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.470
I can't shake the feeling
of her warmth.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.460
Impossible...

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:26.510
It really did just wither away.

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:30.110
Was everything that happened
in that valley just a dream?

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.100
Just like these flowers.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:37.800
When I get back to the real world, everything
will dissipate, just like a dream.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.910
This is a piece of my heart.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.130
The love of the
Scarlet Angel?

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.920
Could she possibly
be in love with me?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.660
The weather in these mountains
is so unpredictable.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.070
Water...

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.650
Water is so strange.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.280
Water. The heart of water.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.840
Ryuujin is the heart of water.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.100
Ryuujin's grief...

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.090
His rage...

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.600
Water is the source of all life.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:26.220
Every animal, human and plant
is blessed by Ryuujin.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:29.900
The heart of water
nurtures all life.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.070
I can do it!

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.140
I can perform as water!

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.420
Everyone, please!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.400
Please don't get
in the way!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.700
Now, I'd like to see both
of you acting out water.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.650
Please allow me to go first.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.230
Look, she's a big fish!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.260
Idiot! How stupid are you?!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:05.400
I want to see the human
prince so badly.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:10.110
But I'm a mermaid. My wish
will never come true.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:22.620
I want to find that man who nearly died when he was
thrown from his ship that crashed in the storm.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.880
She stood up! The mermaid
princess stood up!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:30.710
Since the day I left him, day and night,
my heart has been yours.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.210
That's enough.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:36.150
That was a beautiful
depiction of water, Ayumi.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.610
Thank you very much.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.850
That was wonderful, Ayumi!

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:42.740
Let's see your water
next, Maya.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.210
Okay!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.240
What's happening?
What's going on?

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:53.740
Where did Maya go?

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.070
Water, go!

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:11.400
Show the humans the iron hammer of your rage!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.400
Ryuujin.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.560
This is Maya's depiction
of water.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.200
You humans: You who
know no gratitude.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.660
I give you water to
drink, fish to eat,

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:26.600
and turn into clouds to rain down
my blessings on you, and yet,

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.130
not a single one of you
is truly grateful!

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:34.300
You change the direction of my rivers
and you dam up my water,

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.220
and you dump your filth
into my reservoirs!

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.050
Go, water!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:45.360
Destroy the villages!
Show them my rage!

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:46.720
Ryuujin.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.760
Level the mountains!

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:54.840
Pull everything down into
the depths of your vortex!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.320
Go, water!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.340
Stop there!

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:05.350
Okay.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:11.040
Very innovative to pick Ryuujin
for your depiction of water.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.080
Thank you.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.730
Why did you decide to jump
out of the waterfall?

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:19.830
I thought that if I could use the power of the
waterfall, or rather, the power of nature,

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.090
it would make my
acting better...

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.050
You are quite the girl,
Maya.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:29.230
For playing the god of water, Ryuujin,
that waterfall was perfect.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.840
And you realized that potential
in an instant.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:35.840
Maya, is that your talent?

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:40.860
Whose acting made a deeper
impression on you, Genzo?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.350
I suppose Ayumi's acting was
better and more expressive,

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:48.590
but I would have to say that Maya's
acting made the deeper impression.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.610
Maya. What an
interesting girl.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:55.090
She uses her instinct to act.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:58.610
But you are spectacular
too, Ayumi.

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.920
You are so skilled with your expressions.
With your acting.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.980
Not to mention beautiful.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.060
But more importantly,
you have charisma.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.240
So far, you have won
in every way.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.800
But...

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.990
Maya has natural talent that
draws the audience in.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:21.550
And that makes an impression on the audience that
stays with them, long after the curtain has fallen.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.820
We will have to decide which one of them
is better suited to play the Scarlet Angel...

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.510
in the final test: Earth.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.620
I really want to see what
they come up with.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:45.000
Where... am I?

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:54.480
You're... the one
who saved me?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.970
And the police haven't
given a statement?

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:02.440
No. Everyone has
given up hope.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:03.990
But that's...

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:08.720
The board members are all trying to secure their
own positions now that my father is gone.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:13.620
Well, you know, Mr. Masumi
isn't his real son, after all...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:19.020
This could be a good
opportunity for us.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:23.600
Miss Shiori, now that I have lost the
backing of Eisuke Hayami's name,

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:27.410
maybe it's a good time for you
to reconsider our relationship.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.350
How can you say
such a thing?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:35.380
I will stay by your side, no
matter what happens.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:36.970
Miss Shiori...

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:56.840
Someone has finally
come for me.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.430
But you're...

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.030
The earth.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.710
Acting out the earth.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:05.070
But what is the earth?

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:06.470
I don't know.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.390
How sweet!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.530
It's a little baby carrot!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.840
Vegetables grow in the earth.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.870
No, not just vegetables,
but all plants.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:26.240
They bloom and grow fruit. Everything
else grows naturally in the soil too.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.700
Rocks are hardened earth.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:38.990
Stones are large
masses of earth.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:45.260
They all have different forms,

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.480
and they all feel different
to the touch.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:51.000
All kinds of forms, all kinds of textures.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.230
And they're all part
of the earth.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.560
Some are so sharp, they
can cut your hand.

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.440
This is also earth.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.050
The earth fosters life.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.330
But what is life, exactly?

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:16.340
Things are born out of the earth,
they live, and then they die.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.090
It's the mother that fosters life.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:25.860
Mother Nature. The
power of the earth.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.300
A mother's love!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.800
Native Arts Museum

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.820
An earthenware vessel
from the Jomon period.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.020
How were they able to make
things out of the earth?

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.200
Jomon...

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.030
Ceremonies...

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:46.690
Energy. The god of earth.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:52.480
This is it! A ceremonial Jomon pot!
My depiction of earth!

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:58.130
And now, let's see your
depictions of the earth.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.200
We will start with Ayumi
Himekawa.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.300
Here I go.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.330
A snake!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:15.270
Her movements are so powerful
and lively. Amazing.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.600
You can drink from it,

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.320
or put things into it.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.780
You can carry things in it.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.430
The jar broke!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.170
And now, it's Maya
Kitajima's turn.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.420
Yes!

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.930
What's that? What's
she doing?

00:16:56.350 --> 00:17:01.790
Growing... growing...
growing...

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:09.530
Turning, turning,
turning, turning.

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.470
Who am I?

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.390
Why have I awoken?

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:22.010
Ah, it's because the earth's
getting too cramped for me.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:28.710
My body is gathering strength
and every day, I grow bigger.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:39.650
I'll break out of my skin
and grow up and up!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:45.250
This is a seed. She's acting
out a seed sprouting.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:50.650
The first thing I'll see when I break free of the
earth is the blue sky and the white clouds.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:54.700
And then, the sun with
its gilded crown!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:59.510
But how do I know this?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:03.570
Because my mom taught me!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:10.020
I'm inside my warm mother. I wish
I could stay like this forever.

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:18.970
But I want to see them all... the sun,
the blue sky, the white clouds.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.000
I want to touch them...

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:25.030
the wind, the rain, the water.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:28.680
Even if it's scary or
difficult, I'll be fine!

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.530
Because I'm sure it's wonderful
above ground!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.180
I'm sure it's a fun place to be!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.930
That was just... extraordinary.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:46.090
The etudes of the Scarlet
Angel, depicting nature:

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:49.760
Wind, fire, water, earth.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:52.080
This is it.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.490
You did a good job.

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:02.670
Even now, this brings back
so many memories.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:07.080
It takes me back- the cheering,
the applause.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:10.540
I can even recall the smell
of the stage back then.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:14.780
So, this is the costume and the
mask of the Scarlet Angel?

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:20.650
You two should already understand
the Scarlet Angel.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:25.130
You will play the Scarlet
Angel in a week's time.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.600
The stage will be the
Valley of the Plums.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.140
The etudes you have performed
up to this point will come in handy.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:34.130
"Who? Who is trying to wake me?"

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:37.340
"Is it the spirit of the trees or the silence of evening..."

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.130
"No, this is the scent
of blood."

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.640
"I can see two spirals crashing
against one another."

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:48.650
"One red, the other white; two tops
that will shake heaven and earth."

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:56.220
"How foolish you are.
You do not realize that the things that move you
are also your true form."

00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:01.640
"Nor do you understand the love of the god
of heaven and earth that raised you."

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.610
"This land houses the gods."

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.220
"This is hallowed ground."

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.680
"The Valley of the Plums
is my body."

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.870
"My power will ascend into the
skies as a helix and foster...

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:16.040
the creatures of the earth, the
creatures of the water."

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:20.570
She is a fairy goddess who
commands all of nature.

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:25.570
What did Ms. Tsukikage mean
when she said that?

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:29.800
You two should already understand
the Scarlet Angel.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.090
Masumi...

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:41.350
I'm glad I told my subordinates to keep an
eye on Chigusa Tsukikage and Genzo.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.010
Father, let's go home.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.150
We have to take you to a hospital
where you can be treated.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.980
No! I'm not going back.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:54.170
Masumi, the person who saved me when
I was dying was Chigusa Tsukikage!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.410
That woman! Chigusa Tsukikage!

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:02.550
What?! You've found
President Hayami?

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:05.310
Nurse, can you please finish the preparations?

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.030
They've found Mr. Masumi's
father and he's unhurt!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.690
Please make the necessary
preparations.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:19.560
When I'm having difficulties acting,
I will attempt to carve something.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.600
Thank you very much,
Master Kaikei.

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:30.100
Those two have now finally begun
to rehearse for the Scarlet Angel.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.260
It's been a while,

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:34.330
Ichiren.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.850
My lady!

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:41.520
This can't be...

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.260
My lady?

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:48.980
Ichiren, after we've
come so far...

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
I can go anywhere... One life.

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:29.330
Ichiren, my hand has been in yours
since the day you saved me.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:32.040
You're the other
half of my soul.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:38.500
You gave me a name, put me on stage, and
let me have the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:23:39.050 --> 00:23:42.950
You gave me life and
made it shine.

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:51.280
Can I follow you
now... Ichiren?

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 49 - The
Other Half of My Soul
